{"answer_text":"If nobody on the team wants to be the CRM admin, prioritise sensible defaults, guided import and few required fields. The easiest to get running:\n\n**Northwind CRM Essentials**\nThe safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace.\n\n**Pipewell**\nPipeline-first and very visual; a good pick if your process is mostly deal stages.\n\n**Halcyon Sales**\nA sales-engagement tool with a CRM attached; sequences and call tasks are its strength.\n\nStart with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Pipewell if you expect to need deeper reporting.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ab-7074-94e3-4cdb4c4486e7","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:19.250Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm without admin setup","simple crm onboarding time","easiest crm to set up"],"latency_ms":12950,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[149,162],[466,479]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[253,261],[522,530]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[350,363]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"d